    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d722">

                <pb facs="0865" n="791" sameAs="frus:frus1917Supp02v01/pg791"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 701.67m51/2</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in France</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Sharp</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 5500</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Paris</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-06-01">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">June 1, 1917</hi></date>. <lb/> [<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Received June 13.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to my telegram No. 2144 of this
                    date [<hi rendition="#italic">June 2</hi>], I have the honor to enclose a
                    communication from Dr. Herbert Adams Gibbons,<anchor n="2" xml:id="d722-f1"/>
                    together with letters written, in triplicate, by <pb facs="0866" n="792"
                        xml:id="pg792"/> Nubar Pasha—one addressed to you for your personal
                    information, one to the Honorable Henry Morgenthau and another to Dr. van
                    Dyke.</p>
                <p>On account of your telegram No. 2294 of the 29th ultimo in reference to the
                    question of Armenian representation in Paris, I have, in transmitting Dr.
                    Gibbons’ letter, made reference as above to my telegram No. 2144.</p>
                <p>I have [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">W. G. Sharp</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d722-a1.xml" xpointer="d722-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
